@@ -40,3 +40,32 @@ Customers are represented by `User` records filtered to `role = CUSTOMER`.
 | `POST /products` | Allowed | Denied | Denied | Admin-only write. |
 | `PATCH /products/:id` | Allowed | Denied | Denied | Admin-only write. |
 | `DELETE /products/:id` | Allowed | Denied | Denied | Admin-only write. |
+
+## Projects (`/projects`)
+
+A project is everything for or about one customer: their files, designs, leads, bookings, milestones, payments, invoices, calls, portal messages, installer notes and tasks, and installer assignment history. Visibility follows the relationship, not the screen.
+
+| Endpoint | ADMIN | INSTALLER | CUSTOMER | Ownership / scope rule |
+| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
+| `GET /projects` | Allowed (all, searchable) | Allowed (assigned now) | Allowed (self) | Installer: customers on leads assigned to them now (open `installer_assignments` row, or `leads.assignedToId`). |
+| `GET /projects/:customerId` | Allowed | Assigned now | Self only | Contact details for staff and the assigned installer only. |
+| `GET /projects/:customerId/items` | Allowed (everything) | Assigned now | Self only | Customers never see installer notes, tasks, the activity log or installer profiles; installers see only their own sale price / profit; call wrap-up notes, numbers and payment processor ids are staff-only. |
+| `GET /projects/:customerId/assignments` | Allowed | Assigned now | Self only | Current and past installers with dates and reasons. |
+| `POST /projects/:customerId/assignments` | Allowed | Denied | Denied | REPLACE closes the current installer's row and moves `leads.assignedToId`; ADD works alongside. Customers and installers ask through the AI platform, which sends it to staff. |
+| `GET /projects/people/:userId/items` | Allowed (anyone) | Self only | Self only | A person's own payments, payouts, invoices, files, bookings and tasks. |
+
+## Partners (`/partners`)
+
+| Endpoint | ADMIN | INSTALLER | CUSTOMER | Ownership / scope rule |
+| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
+| `GET /partners`, `GET /partners/:id` | Allowed | Allowed | Allowed | Retailers, DNSPs and suppliers documents are sent to. |
+| `POST /partners`, `PATCH /partners/:id` | Allowed | Denied | Denied | Contacts the AI finds are saved `verified = false`; the first send needs a staff OK. |
+
+## Installer customer documents (`/installer-customer-documents`) — additions
+
+| Endpoint | ADMIN | INSTALLER | CUSTOMER | Ownership / scope rule |
+| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
+| `GET /installer-customer-documents?customerId=` | Allowed (every installer's) | Own uploads for linked customers | Self (all installers') | Unchanged for installers and customers. |
+| `GET /installer-customer-documents/:id` | Allowed | Denied | Denied | Staff / AI platform. |
+| `PATCH /installer-customer-documents/:id/ai` | Allowed | Denied | Denied | AI labels, read values, issues, review state, lead, S3 key. |
+
